        <analyzedElement xsi:type="TalendMetadata:MetadataColumn" href="../../metadata/fileDelimited/lago_de_datos_grupo5/INEC_NBI_8_1_canton_provincia_0.1.item#_pHkaQ9i7EfGS4Oy_nGQk2w"/>
        <indicatorDefinition href="../../TDQ_Libraries/Indicators/System Indicators/Simple Statistics/Distinct_Count_0.1.definition#_ccHq0BF2Ed2PKb6nEJEvhw"/>
        <builtInIndicatorDefinition xmi:id="_HWZngNoIEfGjVb1XdXSgUA" name="Distinct Count" label="Distinct Count">
          <taggedValue xmi:id="_HWZngdoIEfGjVb1XdXSgUA" tag="Description" value="counts the number of distinct rows (like a &quot;SELECT DISTINCT&quot; SQL statement)"/>
          <taggedValue xmi:id="_HWZngtoIEfGjVb1XdXSgUA" tag="Purpose" value="evaluates the number of distinct records"/>
          <sqlGenericExpression xmi:id="_HWZng9oIEfGjVb1XdXSgUA" body="SELECT COUNT(*) FROM (SELECT DISTINCT &lt;%=__COLUMN_NAMES__%> FROM &lt;%=__TABLE_NAME__%> &lt;%=__WHERE_CLAUSE__%>) A" language="SQL"/>
